{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47319","headline":"过天门山怀友 · 吴筠","name":"过天门山怀友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"举帆遇风劲，逸势如飞奔。\n缥缈凌烟波，崩腾走川原。\n两山夹沧江，豁尔开天门。\n须臾轻舟远，想象孤屿存。\n归路日已近，怡然慰心魂。\n所经多奇趣，待与吾友论。\n一日如三秋，相思意弥敦。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47319.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47319","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}